sequenceDiagram
  participant S as GameSession
  participant C as ChunkStreamer
  participant J as RunStateStore
  participant W as GenerationWorker
  participant R as RenderSystem
  participant P as CollisionWorld
  S->>C: update two-way window
  par Build section
    C->>W: ChunkBuildRequest
    W->>W: generate route and mesh rings
    W-->>C: transfer ChunkBuildResult
  and Load spent state
    C->>J: loadSpent(runId, key)
    J-->>C: spent entity IDs
  end
  C->>C: validate request and combine state
  Note over S,P: Activate ready data atomically at a tick boundary
  C->>R: install meshes at current phase
  C->>P: install collision and entities
  Note over S,C: Missing terrain suspends<br/>simulation and timing
  C->>J: persist dirty IDs and flush
  J-->>C: acknowledged
  C->>P: remove old section
  C->>R: dispose old geometry
